  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UDECA Bottom Land Irrigation Rice Production Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The cooperative wishes to acquire production equipment to mechanize rice production in order to enable its members to produce more to improve production and yields.They ask for working capital for the purchase of rice from producers to increase the turnover of the cooperative.It wishes to train its members on production techniques to improve crop yields and the income of its members.</narrative>
  </description>
